@startuml
actor DRIVER
actor CUSTOMER
participant "Driver App" as App
participant "NestJS API" as API
participant "OTP/SMS Provider" as SMS
participant "Object Storage" as Storage
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket

DRIVER -> App : Chọn đơn cần giao
App -> API : POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/delivery/start
API -> DB : Kiểm tra tài xế được phân công, chuyển OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
DB --> API : Order OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
API --> App : 200 Order OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
App -> API : POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/delivery/otp
API -> DB : Kiểm tra đơn OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
API -> SMS : Gửi OTP tới người nhận
SMS --> CUSTOMER : SMS chứa OTP
API --> App : 202 OTP sent (không trả mã OTP)
CUSTOMER -> DRIVER : Cung cấp OTP trực tiếp
DRIVER -> App : Nhập OTP + chọn ảnh chứng minh
App -> API : POST /api/v1/media/presigned-uploads
API --> App : presigned upload URL + objectKey
App -> Storage : PUT ảnh theo presigned URL
Storage --> App : 200 Uploaded
App -> API : POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/delivery/confirm
API -> API : Verify OTP, quyền DRIVER, objectKey
API -> DB : Transaction: DeliveryAttempt + COD + Order DELIVERED + history
DB --> API : Delivery completed
API -> Socket : Emit delivery:completed + order:status_changed
API --> App : 200 Delivery result
App --> DRIVER : Hiển thị giao hàng thành công
@enduml
